{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/660323-cyborg-hunters","id":660323,"title":"Cyborg Hunters?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-10T21:46:31-07:00","id":660323,"title":"Cyborg Hunters?","content":"I was trying to see if there was a way to play a Cyborg Hunter, and the closest thing I could spot from reskimming the corebook was Cheiron Group, but that isn't really the same thing. So my question is: Is there a robotic Cyborg group im just not finding or a variation of Cheiron that deals with Cyborgs instead of the whole grafting thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2448-dante","name":"Dante","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2448_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T23:28:34-07:00","id":660408,"title":"","content":"Within the book called Mirrors: Bleeding Edge, there is a thing called Plugins, which are cybernetic implants and so forth. It's for playing games in the future, but there's no reason you can't use them in a modern time. There's also the embedded guns etc. the Unfleshed Prometheans can use (it's a merit). So take those two things and make up a Hunter organization. Or maybe a tier 1 Hunter with a weird benefactor. <br /> <br /> But no, there isn't a canon Hunter organization that does what you're looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/274-enokh","name":"Enokh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T01:16:38-07:00","id":660501,"title":"","content":"TF:V might have some stuff that could be implanted. You need to design it yourself, but their powers are about futuristic technologies, aren't they?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4560-madfox11","name":"Madfox11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T03:39:30-07:00","id":661743,"title":"","content":"While there are no official examples of it, Cheiron can do cyborgs.<br /> <br /> Cheiron rips of parts of supernaturals, yes, that's their thing.<br /> <br /> The unchained are biomechanical.<br /> <br /> There are prometheans who are robots.<br /> <br /> Maniken changelings, perhaps some more kiths I can't remember offhand. <br /> <br /> There's a lineage of mages whose legacy attainments manifest as cybernetic parts.<br /> <br /> A Beast's horror might be technological.<br /> <br /> Someone claimed by a technology spirit might manifest dread powers with a likewise technological bent. <br /> <br /> The disease that empowers the Infected from the upcoming Hurt Locker can be technorganic in nature. <br /> <br /> And since Tetsuo was listed as one of the inspirations for Deviant, I bet some technologically themed thaumatech can be had over there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}